>> title: Red Lentil Soup
>> course: lunch
>> servings: 4
>> source: Studio Cooking wiki

Soften @onion{1} and @garlic{2%cloves} in @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #large pot{} for ~{8%minutes}.

Add @cumin{2%tsp} and @smoked paprika{1%tsp}, then @red lentils{250%g}, @chopped tomatoes{400%g} and @vegetable stock{1%l}.

Simmer for ~{20%minutes}, blend half, and finish with @lemon{1/2}. Keeps for three days — lunch for the week's sessions.
